  "description": "Universal pure C# .NET 10 Multimodal LLM, Generative Image & Video, Vision & Voice inference engine supporting Meta Llama 3, DeepSeek V2/V3/R1 (MLA + MoE), Microsoft Phi-3/Phi-4, Google Gemma 2/4, Mistral, Alibaba Qwen 2/2.5/3.5, FLUX.1 & Wan 2.1 Diffusion Transformers, VAE Decoders, ViT/SigLIP Vision Preprocessing, 2D Spatial Multimodal Projectors, Video Frame Samplers, 3D-RoPE Spatio-Temporal Embeddings, KittenTTS Neural Speech Synthesis, and Formant TTS. Features Tiered Virtual Memory Management (Hot VRAM / Warm Pinned Host RAM / Cold NVMe mmap), Bandwidth-Adaptive Co-Scheduling (q* policy), Tiered MoE Runner, and IQ1/IQ2/IQ3/IQ4/Q2_K/Q4_K quantization kernels. Native AOT compatible, zero-copy GGUF memory-mapped files, AVX-512/AVX2 quantized SIMD kernels, bare-metal GPU acceleration, and pure C# Log-Mel audio DSP. Zero Python, zero C++ runtime dependencies.",
